@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<style>
    body {
        background: #f4f6f8;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 40px;
    }

    .policy-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 15px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    h1, h2 {
        color: #00bfae;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p, li {
        color: #333;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .highlight {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #008e82;
    }
</style>

<div class="policy-container">
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

    <p>
        At <span class="highlight">BitBuilt</span>, your privacy is important to us. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information in relation to our PC Inventory Management System.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>User Information:</strong> such as name, email address, and contact details when registering or interacting with our system.</li>
        <li><strong>Inventory Data:</strong> including PC product names, brands, categories, and prices entered by users or admins.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage Logs:</strong> for tracking login activity, edits, and other system interactions to improve service and security.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>To manage user accounts and access levels.</li>
        <li>To store and update PC product inventory data.</li>
        <li>To improve system functionality and user experience.</li>
        <li>To ensure compliance with policies and prevent unauthorized access.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Data Protection</h2>
    <p>
        We use secure technologies and encryption methods to protect all stored data. Only authorized personnel have access to sensitive information.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Sharing</h2>
    <p>
        We do not sell, trade, or rent user information. Data may be shared with trusted service providers only to support the functionality of our system under strict confidentiality agreements.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
        You have the right to view, update, or request deletion of your personal data at any time. Please contact our support team for any data-related concerns.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
        We may update this policy occasionally to reflect system improvements or legal requirements. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.
    </p>

    <p><em>Last updated: May 2025</em></p>
</div>
